### ============================================================================
### TRANSFER ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================
### Transferencias entre wallets

@api = https://servicioshilda.orioncaribe.com/api/v1
@accessToken = your_jwt_token_here

### ============================================================================
### 1. POST /transfer/initiate - Initiate Token Transfer
### ============================================================================
### Inicia una transferencia entre wallets
### Pasos:
### 1. Llamar este endpoint
### 2. Obtener transactionBase64 para firmar
### 3. Firmar con wallet origen
### 4. Confirmar transferencia

POST {{@api}}/transfer/initiate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

{
  "fromWallet": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
  "toWallet": "ABC123DEF456GHI789JKL012MNO345PQR678STU9",
  "amount": 100
}

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "transactionId": "xfr_12345",
###   "transactionBase64": "AQAAA...",
###   "message": "Sign this transaction with your wallet"
### }


### ============================================================================
### 2. POST /transfer/confirm/:transactionId - Confirm Transfer
### ============================================================================
### Confirma una transferencia después de firmarla

POST {{@api}}/transfer/confirm/xfr_12345
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromWallet": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
  "signature": "5K1fvW2xY3zZ4aA5bB6cC7dD8eE9fF0gG1hH2iI3jJ4kK5lL6mM7nN8oO9pP0qQ1rR2sS3tT4uU5vV6wW7xX8yY9zZ",
  "transactionHash": "5K1fvW2xY3zZ4aA5bB6cC7dD8eE9fF0gG1hH2iI3jJ4kK5lL6mM7nN8oO9pP0qQ1rR2sS3tT4uU5vV6wW7xX8yY9zZ"
}

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Transfer confirmed",
###   "amount": 100,
###   "transactionHash": "..."
### }


### ============================================================================
### 3. GET /transfer/status/:transactionId - Check Transfer Status
### ============================================================================
### Verifica el estado de una transferencia

GET {{@api}}/transfer/status/xfr_12345

### Response should be 200 OK with transfer status


### ============================================================================
### 4. GET /transfer/history/:wallet - Get Transfer History
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene histórico de transferencias de un wallet

GET {{@api}}/transfer/history/4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8?limit=20&offset=0

### Response should be 200 OK with array of transfers

